/*
 * E1026_nul_byte_in_source.gray - placeholder for the E1026 diagnostic
 * ("NUL byte in source file").
 *
 * E1026 can only be triggered by a source file that contains a raw NUL byte.
 * The repository's sanity check treats any file containing a NUL byte as
 * binary and blocks the pull request, so such a file cannot be committed.
 * This file therefore contains no NUL byte and always passes.
 */

do main() {
    println("ALL TESTS PASSED")
}
